Fix uncaught error in business.ts.

## Issue
Line 595-609: JSON.parse can throw for invalid input

## Current
```typescript
conditions[key] = JSON.parse(value)
```

## Fix
```typescript
try {
  conditions[key] = JSON.parse(value)
} catch {
  // Treat as string literal
  conditions[key] = value.replace(/^['"]|['"]$/g, '')
}
```

